---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Team — design study">
<main class="wrap team-study">
  <header class="team-opening"><p class="eyebrow">Highball Technomancy / The people</p><h1>Team</h1><p class="opening-copy">A small lab. A fairly unreasonable list of things to make.</p></header>
  <section class="portrait-story" aria-labelledby="patrick-name">
    <div class="portrait-column">
      <div class="portrait" role="img" aria-label="Placeholder for a portrait of Patrick at his workbench">
        <span class="corner top-left"></span><span class="corner bottom-right"></span>
        <div class="portrait-monogram" aria-hidden="true">PH</div>
        <div class="portrait-caption"><span>01 / THE WORKBENCH</span><p>A portrait belongs here.<br />Preferably with some evidence<br />of what happened to the desk.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="margin-note">The project list got out of hand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="person-story">
      <p class="eyebrow role">Founder / Highball Technomancy</p>
      <h2 id="patrick-name">Patrick Hill</h2>
      <p class="lead">There was probably a smaller<br class="desktop-break" /> project to start with.</p>
      <div class="story-copy"><p>Highball is where I give the ideas that won't leave me alone somewhere to go. Some turn into useful software. Others turn into much larger questions than I expected.</p><p>AI is involved in a lot of those questions. So are the people using it, the decisions we trust it with, and what happens when a convincing answer isn't actually a good one.</p><p>I'd like this place to make room for both useful things and strange ambitions. Ideally, we'll learn something along the way and have a decent story to tell about it.</p></div>
      <p class="copy-note">Sample introduction for the design study — to be replaced with your own story.</p>
      <div class="person-links"><a href="https://github.com/highball-technomancy">GitHub ↗</a><a href="#contact">Say hello ↓</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="working" aria-labelledby="working-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Around the workbench</p><h2 id="working-title">Room for another mind.</h2></div><div><p>A place here for how collaboration actually works: the people contributing, the tools involved, and the conversations that change a project's direction.</p><p class="copy-note">Reserved for the real story of who helps make the work happen.</p></div></section>
  <section id="contact" class="contact"><p class="eyebrow">Pull up a chair</p><div class="contact-grid"><div><h2>What's on your mind?</h2><p>An idea, a question, or something you think we ought to see.<br class="desktop-break" /> There's a person on the other end.</p></div><div class="contact-action"><a class="email" href="mailto:pahill@technomancyai.com">pahill@technomancyai.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span>Email is a good place to start.</span></div></div></section>
  <p class="study-note">Design study · Portrait placeholder and provisional copy. No biography or collaborator list has been finalized.</p>
</main>
<style>
@font-face{font-family:'Typical Writer';src:url('/fonts/typical-writer-font/TypicalWriter-G3LO.ttf') format('truetype');font-display:swap}
.team-study{padding-top:52px;padding-bottom:24px}.eyebrow{font:11px/1.5 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9d9dab;margin:0 0 16px}.team-opening{margin-bottom:58px}.team-opening h1{font:58px/1.1 Technomancy;color:var(--bright);margin:0 0 18px}.opening-copy{font:300 21px/1.6 var(--serif);color:#bdbdc9;margin:0}.portrait-story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.95fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:92px;align-items:start}.portrait{position:relative;aspect-ratio:4/4.8;background:#191b20;border:1px solid #30373a;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;padding:35px;overflow:hidden}.portrait-monogram{font:140px/1 Technomancy;color:#364941;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:35px}.portrait-caption span{font:10px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.14em;color:#91b8a3}.portrait-caption p{font:300 20px/1.65 var(--serif);color:#bdc5c1;margin:17px 0 0}.corner{position:absolute;width:18px;height:18px;border-color:#69997e}.top-left{left:13px;top:13px;border-left:1px solid;border-top:1px solid}.bottom-right{right:13px;bottom:13px;border-right:1px solid;border-bottom:1px solid}.margin-note{font:17px/1.6 'Typical Writer';color:#baa5ca;margin:19px 0 0;text-align:right}.person-story{padding-top:17px}.role{color:#a794bb}.person-story h2{font:44px/1.2 Technomancy;color:var(--bright);margin:0 0 30px}.lead{font:300 30px/1.45 var(--serif);color:#e0e0e6;margin:0 0 28px}.story-copy{font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;color:#b4b4c0;max-width:52ch}.story-copy p{margin:0 0 20px}.copy-note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#8e8e9c;max-width:55ch}.person-links{display:flex;gap:30px;margin-top:27px;font-size:13px;color:#b9d4c5}.person-links a{border-bottom:1px solid #496454;padding-bottom:5px}.working{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;border-top:1px solid #303039;margin-top:90px;padding:40px 0 56px}.working h2{font:24px/1.5 'Typical Writer';color:#c8b6d7;margin:0}.working p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#b4b4c0;margin:0 0 15px}.working p.copy-note{font-size:12px;color:#8e8e9c}.contact{border-top:1px solid #303039;padding:48px 0 62px;scroll-margin-top:25px}.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}.contact h2{font:300 38px/1.3 var(--serif);color:var(--bright);margin:0 0 18px}.contact p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#b4b4c0;margin:0}.contact-action{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;align-items:flex-start}.email{font-size:clamp(16px,1.8vw,23px);color:#cbdcd2;border-bottom:1px solid #548968;padding-bottom:9px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.email span{color:#00f867;margin-left:10px}.contact-action>span{font-size:12px;color:#9d9dab}.study-note{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#8e8e9c;margin:0 0 25px}a:hover{color:white}a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #00f867;outline-offset:5px}
@media(max-width:1000px){.portrait-story{gap:45px}.portrait-monogram{font-size:105px}.portrait{padding:26px}.lead{font-size:27px}.working{gap:35px}.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}}
@media(max-width:700px){.team-study{padding-top:32px}.team-opening{margin-bottom:32px}.team-opening h1{font-size:43px}.portrait-story{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.portrait-column{max-width:440px;width:100%}.portrait{aspect-ratio:5/4}.portrait-monogram{font-size:82px;margin-top:0}.portrait-caption p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}.person-story{padding:0}.person-story h2{font-size:36px}.working{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;margin-top:55px}.contact h2{font-size:31px}.desktop-break{display:none}}
</style>
</Base>
